			<string id="String_Policy_Regulate_information_47" >Regulate information updates</string>
			<string id="String_Explain_When_this_policy_48" >When this policy is enabled, the ControlUp Monitor will pull performance updates from the managed computers per the schedule defined here instead of receiving push updates. 

https://support.controlup.com/hc/en-us/articles/207202035-Locking-UI-With-Group-Policy</string>
			<string id="String_Policy_Disable_process_52" >Disable process data collection</string>
			<string id="String_Explain_When_this_policy_53" >When this policy is enabled, the ControlUp Monitor will not gather process data from managed computers.

https://support.controlup.com/hc/en-us/articles/207202035-Locking-UI-With-Group-Policy</string>
			<string id="String_Policy_Disable_process_6" >Disable process flat views</string>
			<string id="String_Explain_When_this_policy_7" >When this policy is enabled, the Processes, Accounts and Applications views will be disabled and their respective buttons in the 'My Organization' pane will be greyed out.

Process information is no longer gathered real-time but is still available on-demand by double-clicking on a specific computer or session.


https://support.controlup.com/hc/en-us/articles/207202035-Locking-UI-With-Group-Policy</string>
			<string id="String_Policy_Regulate_information_29" >Regulate information updates</string>
			<string id="String_Explain_When_this_policy_30" >When this policy is enabled, the ControlUp console will pull performance updates from the managed computers per the schedule defined here instead of receiving push updates. 

https://support.controlup.com/hc/en-us/articles/207202035-Locking-UI-With-Group-Policy</string>
			<string id="String_Policy_Search_box_behavior_34" >Search box behavior</string>
			<string id="String_Explain_This_policy_determines_35" >This policy determines which columns of the information grid in the ControlUp console will be searched when text is typed in the search box.

https://support.controlup.com/hc/en-us/articles/207202035-Locking-UI-With-Group-Policy</string>
			<string id="String_Policy_DropList_Select_Search_box_behavior_All_fields_37" >All fields</string>
